OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFantasist killed woman in 'brutal
OL,4,Arevenge attack'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fantasist and thief has been found
OL,7,Fguilty of murdering a woman in a
OL,8,F"brutal and fatal revenge attack" at an
OL,9,FAirbnb after she discovered he had
OL,10,Fstolen from her and told lies.
OL,12,FUniversity dropout, Deepak Sandhu, 24,
OL,13,Fwho claimed to be a model and actor,
OL,14,Fbought knives in Asda and travelled to
OL,15,FEarl's Court, west London where he
OL,16,Fkilled Xiaoqing Ke, 39, on 10 December,
OL,17,Fthe Old Bailey was told.
OL,19,FTheir relationship broke down after Ke
OL,20,Fdemanded her stolen #500 back and told
OL,21,Fhim she did not want to see him any
OL,22,Fmore.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
