OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutor Caroline Carberry KC added
OL,7,Fthat the failed AI student was a
OL,8,F"fantasist" and an "obsessed,
OL,9,Fmanipulative young man who could not
OL,10,Faccept her rejection of him".
